 8/book-club-cozy-capers-mysteries\n\nA monthly discussion on crime novels
  featuring sleuths\, quirky supporting characters and homey communities. 
 This month's novel is Fair Play by Louise Hegarty. Abigail\, her brother 
 Benjamin and their friends love to throw a murder mystery party every New
  Year's Eve. This year's event is a smashing success\, except in the morn
 ing\, everyone wakes up but Benjamin.Cozy Capers & Mysteries Reading List
